
## Ignore the canvaskit file while commiting as it could be stale
## Generate your own canvaskit when testing Skia web rendering localy on your machine
dreamcharter.app/public/canvaskit.wasm

## Ignore the env file containing API keys and security tokens
dreamcharter.app/.env

## Ignore the node_memory function for checking node memory usage
dreamcharter.app/node_memory.ts
